---
flowchart LR
  accTitle: dof::AuxiliaryDepthOfFieldTexture · 对象关系
  accDescr: 当前对象及全部直接关联对象。
  %% n*/e* 是业务节点/关系，sc* 是阶段关系；layout_* 仅用于排版。
  classDef node_system fill:#EFF3F8,stroke:#3567A6,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef node_component fill:#F1F5F2,stroke:#4B8060,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef edge_read stroke:#3567A6,stroke-width:1.6px,stroke-dasharray:6 4
  classDef edge_write stroke:#2F7161,stroke-width:1.8px
  classDef external_node stroke-dasharray:6 4
  n0@{ shape: rounded, label: "**AuxiliaryDepthOfFieldTexture**<br/>提供六边形散景模糊的第二渲染目标。" }
  class n0 node_component
  n1@{ shape: rounded, label: "**prepare​_​auxiliary​_​depth​_​of​_​field​_​**<br/>**textures**<br/>为 Bokeh 景深分配第二颜色输出。" }
  class n1 node_system
  n2@{ shape: rounded, label: "**depth​_​of​_​field**<br/>以两阶段全屏通道执行景深模糊。" }
  class n2 node_system
  n3@{ shape: rounded, label: "**extract​_​depth​_​of​_​field​_​settings**<br/>把透视相机景深设置转换为 GPU 参数。" }
  class n3 node_system
  n1 e0@-->|"插入"| n0
  class e0 edge_write
  n0 e1@--> n2
  class e1 edge_read
  n3 e2@-->|"移除"| n0
  class e2 edge_write
  e0@{ curve: basis }
  e2@{ curve: basis }
